# LLM Configuration
# =================

# Primary provider: custom endpoint (recommended for production)
# Uncomment and set these for custom API:
LLM_API_URL=https://apihub.agnes-ai.com/v1
LLM_API_KEY=sk-...
# Model choice (measured on the full planner prompt, 2026-09-22):
#   agnes-3.0-flash   ~3s/step, zero reasoning tokens -> recommended for the
#                     live agent loop (fast, and it keeps the full checklist)
#   agnes-2.5-flash   ~5-8s/step, full chain-of-thought -> slower but more
#                     "deliberate"; use if you want max per-step reasoning
# Either works; 3.0-flash is the default here for speed.
LLM_MODEL=agnes-3.0-flash

# Fallback: Ollama (local)
# Uncomment if you want local fallback:
OLLAMA_HOST=http://localhost:11434
OLLAMA_MODEL=qwen2.5:1.5b

# Provider selection: auto | custom | ollama
# 'auto' tries custom first, falls back to Ollama
LLM_PROVIDER=auto

# For testing without API keys:
# LLM_PROVIDER=ollama
